1
00:00:04,822 --> 00:00:07,574
Keep extending your leg
like that!

2
00:00:07,590 --> 00:00:08,630
You have to remember this!

3
00:00:08,842 --> 00:00:10,482
I'll be right back
just need the restroom.

4
00:00:14,305 --> 00:00:15,473
Ji-sung!

5
00:00:15,682 --> 00:00:18,977
You said
we'd meet today, right?

6
00:00:19,602 --> 00:00:22,063
Yeah. Is now okay?

7
00:00:22,063 --> 00:00:23,063
Sure.

8
00:00:23,690 --> 00:00:26,484
But what's up?

9
00:00:26,484 --> 00:00:28,403
Today marks exactly one month

10
00:00:28,403 --> 00:00:31,156
since we started treatment.

11
00:00:31,156 --> 00:00:33,283
And you've made great progress

12
00:00:33,283 --> 00:00:35,118
so I just wanted to
celebrate a little.

13
00:00:35,326 --> 00:00:37,746
Got a minute?

14
00:00:37,746 --> 00:00:39,330
Sure.

15
00:00:40,415 --> 00:00:43,752
Ta-da! A little toast.

16
00:00:43,752 --> 00:00:45,879
You planned this?

17
00:00:46,782 --> 00:00:47,783
Is this non-alcoholic?

18
00:00:48,173 --> 00:00:50,175
Well, treatment's
not over yet, right?

19
00:00:50,633 --> 00:00:53,261
Just something light
for the mood.

20
00:00:53,261 --> 00:00:57,265
So once rehab's over...

21
00:00:57,599 --> 00:00:59,267
are you still going to be
just my therapist?

22
00:00:59,267 --> 00:01:00,935
What do you want?

23
00:01:00,935 --> 00:01:02,270
I mean...

24
00:01:03,438 --> 00:01:05,106
maybe we could be closer?

25
00:01:05,106 --> 00:01:07,025
Or is that weird?

26
00:01:07,358 --> 00:01:09,944
Never mind.

27
00:01:09,944 --> 00:01:11,780
Being a little closer
sounds nice.

28
00:01:11,780 --> 00:01:13,490
Then let's try that now.

29
00:01:13,490 --> 00:01:14,657
I'll do the same...

30
00:01:14,657 --> 00:01:16,659
just for today.

31
00:01:17,577 --> 00:01:20,455
Okay, Ji-sung.

32
00:01:28,588 --> 00:01:32,092
Your hair's grown out a lot.
